{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>For the Peace and Order of the Universe!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rocket Squad is a team-based first-person shooter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infiltrate perilous planets, gather resources, and return safely to your shelter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilize each character's unique abilities and strategically form your team to restore order to the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/616252.png?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Agents</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each character possesses unique abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Analyze their strengths and assemble your team strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_02.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Budget Management</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every action consumes funds, and lack of resources can severely hinder mission performance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your finances carefully before and after each operation, and use your team\u2019s budget without waste.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Efficient financial management is the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_09.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Planet Infiltration</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The economic order of the universe has collapsed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The development of the Infinity Quantum Core has enabled infinite cryptocurrency mining, causing this catastrophe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infiltrate dangerous planets to restore peace and order to the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_03.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Combat Against Robots</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The robots have monopolized the Infinity Quantum Core, bringing ruin to the universe's economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">They are no longer mere machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face off against the wealthy robots who have become enemies of the universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_04.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Economic Recovery</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain valuable items and escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raid the vaults of the affluent robots and secure the future of a struggling universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_05.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Enhancement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your character\u2019s abilities with a variety of artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine artifacts that suit your character\u2019s traits to develop your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_06.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shelter Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your shelter is your safe haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate it with various furniture and ornaments to make it truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_07.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a squad with up to four friends and save the universe together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_08.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Shopping","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/94f5ceaf8c3e9c728d2b5ac8476cd1624bb679c8.jpg"},{"name":"Fully Geared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/f35d3f63202a587440c8847c02da5169f9de3182.jpg"},{"name":"Infinite Mining","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/105ed6151dbd4edede0ae5059503ff862c2b096f.jpg"},{"name":"Escape Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/9bf8a406edaf3825f0478dbec495034323eb3a53.jpg"},{"name":"A New Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/d7b815f627002e05a95fcb391615d3aeed7b0dc9.jpg"},{"name":"Reached the Summit!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/4aa54225c442e1cb6583db9321e07cb7c8d17c50.jpg"},{"name":"Golden Agent","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/2d350a56a6069e536bbd05d1af303642a0ef7891.jpg"},{"name":"Shining Diamond","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/97b268576d795adb2c8e020738f2ff9353330b69.jpg"},{"name":"Master Class","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3315230/5746407d2ca9a25f46cb09dbb4f19d6b5647be7c.jpg"},{"name":"Unriva