</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain valuable items and escape safely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Raid the vaults of the affluent robots and secure the future of a struggling universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_05.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Enhancement</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enhance your character\u2019s abilities with a variety of artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine artifacts that suit your character\u2019s traits to develop your own unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_06.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shelter Customization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your shelter is your safe haven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Decorate it with various furniture and ornaments to make it truly yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_07.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Multiplayer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a squad with up to four friends and save the universe together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/extras/RS_Gif_08.gif?t=1744880510\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Jackto Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3315230/header.jpg?t=1744880510","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Mini